'HIDDEN FEATURES'
HEADINGS FROM UNIT 0 GIVES AUTO-HEADINGS.
INPUT FROM UNIT<NOT FILE-INPUT>-N.
READS DATA TO GROUP N  SPECIALLY USEFUL FOR UNIT 4.
